  id: aa3
  title: Villagers
  content: 'As you travel the world, you will attract more and more <b>Villagers</b>
    to your ranks. Their number will be displayed at the top of the screen.


    You
    can, in turn, train people in some craft, make them soldiers or support units,
    it''s up to you.


    However, you always have a villagers <b>Limit</b>, which
    directly depends on your <b>Fame</b> level. If the limit is exceeded, you will
    be feeding idlers, spending <b>Money</b> on them, so always try to maintain an
    optimal number of people.


    Some villagers can start working without prior
    training, for example, on patrol or at some resource extraction sites. Others
    need to be trained in cities or villages, being issued the necessary equipment.'
  section: 0
